  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help to feed Hungry and Malnourished children!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children in Indian streets, slums, and villages are malnourished as their families cannot afford three meals a day. They spend each day hoping that they will find some food to eat at least for the day. The food is either begged, donated by a kind soul, picked from the trash, or by other means. The children don&apos;t know if they will be lucky enough the next day to get food.  Your support can help these children get three nutritious and delicious meals a day and ensure a better life for them.</narrative>
  </description>
